---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="page-static">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Mondeclat does not directly collect personal information from visitors. You can read every article, browse every category, and use the search without creating an account or sharing any data with us. Our website is built to be informative and accessible by default.</p>

    <h2>2. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate traffic patterns — which articles are read, which categories are most popular, where readers come from. These analytics cookies do not identify you personally and you can disable them in your browser settings at any time. Disabling cookies will not affect your ability to read our content.</p>

    <h2>3. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>Mondeclat may earn a small commission when you purchase products through affiliate links in our articles — at no additional cost to you. We only recommend products we genuinely believe in, and our editorial coverage is not influenced by affiliate partnerships. Affiliate links are always disclosed clearly within the article.</p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>Our articles sometimes link to external websites for reference or recommendation. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or terms of those third-party sites, and we encourage you to read their policies before engaging.</p>

    <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
    <p>While we do not collect personal data directly, we take reasonable precautions to protect any information that may pass through our website. No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

    <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Mondeclat is intended for adult readers and does not knowingly collect information from anyone under 13 years of age.</p>

    <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>